;; mail — compose an email and deliver it through a swappable adapter. Vendor-neutral: an
;; adapter is any value with an `Adapter` impl (mail-mailjet is the first; mail-local keeps
;; them in-process with a page to read them).
(project
  :name "mail"
  :version "0.1.0"
  :brood ">= 0.29.2"
  :description
    "Compose an email and deliver it through a swappable adapter — Swoosh, for Brood. Builder, address parsing, validation, telemetry, and memory/log adapters; pair with an adapter package such as mail-mailjet."
  :repository "https://github.com/broodlang/mail")
